  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "The logic followed here is :-\n\nBy using BODMAS RULE :\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/7343256e0e7e524707dcdfd367bec918044f6fb521e0c850a624ce1ade8b96f2.png] \n\nOption 1) : +, ÷ , – , = , × \n\nGiven equation : 88 * 120 * 42 * 240 * 48 * 2\n\nAfter inserting the symbols in given equation the equation is as follows : 88 + 120 ÷ 42 - 240 = 48 × 2\n\n⇒ 88 + __**120 ÷ 42**__ - 240 = 48 × 2\n\n⇒ 88 + 2.8571 - 240 = __**48 × 2**__\n\n⇒ __**88 + 2.8571**__ - 240 = 96\n\n⇒ __**90.8571 - 240**__ = 96\n\n⇒ - 149.1428 ≠ 96\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) : =, × , +, ÷, –\n\nGiven equation : 88 * 120 * 42 * 240 * 48 * 2\n\nAfter inserting the symbols in given equation the equation is as follows : 88 = 120 × 42 + 240 ÷ 48 - 2\n\n⇒ 88 = 120 × 42 + __**240 ÷ 48**__ - 2\n\n⇒ 88 = __**120 × 42**__ + 5 - 2\n\n⇒ 88 = __**5040 + 5**__ - 2\n\n⇒ 88 = __**5045 - 2**__\n\n⇒ 88 ≠ 5043\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) : ×, ÷, =, –, +\n\nGiven equation : 88 * 120 * 42 * 240 * 48 * 2\n\nAfter inserting the symbols in given equation the equation is as follows : 88 × 120 ÷ 42 = 240 - 48 + 2\n\n⇒ 88 × __**120 ÷ 42**__ = 240 - 48 + 2\n\n⇒ __**88 × 2.8571**__ = 240 - 48 + 2\n\n⇒ 251.4285 = __**240**__ - 48 __**+ 2**__\n\n⇒ 251.4285 = __**242 - 48**__\n\n⇒ 251.4285 ≠ 194\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) : =, –, +, ÷, × \n\nGiven equation : 88 * 120 * 42 * 240 * 48 * 2\n\nAfter inserting the symbols in given equation the equation is as follows : 88 = 120 - 42 + 240 ÷ 48 × 2\n\n⇒ 88 = 120 - 42 + __**240 ÷ 48**__ × 2\n\n⇒ 88 = 120 - 42 + __**5 × 2**__\n\n⇒ 88 = __**120**__ - 42 __**+ 10**__\n\n⇒ 88 = __**130 - 42**__\n\n⇒ **88 = 88**\n\n**LHS = RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"=, –, +, ÷, × \".**",
